OL,3,AAI not a threat to films, say Shaun the
OL,4,ASheep creators
OL,5,
OL,6,FShaun the Sheep creators say AI will
OL,7,Fnot replace the craft of storytelling
OL,8,Fas the franchise's latest film arrives
OL,9,Fin UK cinemas.
OL,11,FDirected by Steve Cox and Matthew
OL,12,FWalker, Shaun the Sheep: The Beast of
OL,13,FMossy Bottom has a Halloween flavour as
OL,14,FShaun has to turn into a mad scientist
OL,15,Fto save the day.
OL,17,FSpeaking ahead of its launch, producer
OL,18,FRichard Beek said despite the rise of
OL,19,FAI and CGI within the film industry,
OL,20,Fstop-motion movies are still being made
OL,21,Fand winning BAFTAs.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
