OL,3,AAI not a threat to films, say Shaun the
OL,4,ASheep creators
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Maybe somewhere down the line there's
OL,7,Fa tool we use which uses AI but I don't
OL,8,Fthink it would ever replace the
OL,9,Fstorytelling and creation of those
OL,10,Fstories," he said.
